OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the US president issued an
OL,7,Fexecutive order on Friday night saying
OL,8,Fthat suspending some was in the US
OL,9,F"national interest", prompting a
OL,10,Fbacklash from US lawmakers. Zelensky
OL,11,Fsaid it was unfortunate the US has
OL,12,Fdecided to "completely disregard" the
OL,13,Fsanctions.
OL,15,FRelations between Washington and Kyiv
OL,16,Ffrayed after the US struck a
OL,17,Fcontroversial deal to import Russian
OL,18,Fdiesel. Ukraine then accused the Trump
OL,19,Fadministration of withdrawing key
OL,20,Fmilitary support.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
